<titlePage type="main"> <docTitle> <titlePart type="main"> <hi rendition="#b">Max und Moritz</hi><lb/>
</titlePart> <titlePart type="sub"> <hi rendition="#b">eine<lb/>
Bubenge&#x017F;chichte<lb/>
