&#x017F;ieben Streichen.</hi></titlePart> </docTitle><lb/>
<byline> von<lb/>
<docAuthor> Wilhelm Busch.<lb/>
</docAuthor> </byline> <milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
